@startuml
title 003 搶答與結果判定 - 組件圖
left to right direction

actor "學生" as Student
actor "老師" as Teacher
component "React App" as UI
component "BuzzerAnswerPanel" as StudentPanel
component "TeacherResultsPanel" as TeacherPanel
component "StudentResultsPanel" as StudentResultsPanel
component "RealtimeClient / BuzzerResultsStore" as Client
component "RealtimeHub" as Hub
component "BuzzerResultsService" as Results
component "ActivityState" as Activity
component "GroupRoster" as Groups
component "BuzzerWinningResultsProvider" as Provider
component "GuidedNotesService\n(Feature 002)" as GuidedNotes
component "GoogleSheetsAdapter\n(Feature 002)" as Sheets

Student --> UI : 加入組別、選題、提交答案
Teacher --> UI : 匯入題號、開始／結束、查看進度
UI --> StudentPanel
UI --> TeacherPanel
UI --> StudentResultsPanel
StudentPanel --> Client : student.join / submitAnswer
TeacherPanel --> Client : authenticate / getTeacherProgress
StudentResultsPanel <-- Client : ENDED 結果
Client <--> Hub : WebSocket 訊息與投影
Hub --> Hub : 驗證連線角色、組別、階段
Hub --> Results : 提交、查詢及建立角色限定投影
Results --> Activity : 讀取階段與有序題號
Results --> Groups : 驗證組別及產生全組教師進度
Results --> Results : 同步接受、鎖定及配置 receivedOrder
Hub ..> Client : 題號清單、個人確認、同組 ownProgress、學生結果
Hub ..> Client : 教師登入快照、每筆有效答案或成功匯入題號後的 teacherProgress
Provider --> Results : 讀取每題勝出答案
Provider --> Activity : 檢查階段及題目是否可用
GuidedNotes --> Provider : 取得伺服器權威結果
GuidedNotes --> Sheets : 寫入勝出答案或清空未勝出題目

note bottom of Results
每組每題只保留第一筆有效答案。
receivedOrder 決定每題唯一勝者；不判斷正確性或計分。
end note

note bottom of Hub
學生加入後只收到題號；BUZZING 重連及同組有效提交後，
只向本組學生連線傳送 ownProgress。
ENDED 學生只收到勝出答案與本組作答；老師才收到全組進度。
end note
@enduml
